    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d305-a1">

                <pb facs="0431" n="319" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg319"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister for Foreign Affairs to Chargé
                        Hibben.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Ministry for Foreign Affairs</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The
                                Hague</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1910-11-01"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">November 1,
                    1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Chargé d’affaires</hi>: Referring to your note of
                    the 19th of October last, file 30020.18, I have the honor to inform you that Her
                    Majesty’s Government proposes as date for the opening of the International
                    Conference for Prevention of the Abuse of Opium, Wednesday, the 30th of May,
                    1911.</p>
                <p>In adding that the States intending to participate in the conference have been
                    notified of the above,</p>
                <p>I renew, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">R. de Marees van
                        Swinderen.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
